    "northStar": "The task-centered Xerxes workspace",
    "overview": "Preserve charcoal surfaces, periwinkle actions, restrained separators, and the expressive serif XERXES identity. The current scoped presentation follows Claude desktop Code view: readable conversation, expandable evidence, and persistent task context.",
