        "name": "The Evidence Access Rule",
        "body": "Concise tool rows retain keyboard-operable disclosure and full underlying results. Failed execution exposes its error in the summary; expanded content retains command, output, standard error, and raw input/result. Output has a bounded scroll region (320px), an expanded view (70vh), and text wrapping controls where applicable.",
        "section": "components"
